                Headteacher-&gt;{Deputy1 Deputy2 BusinessManager}
                Deputy1-&gt;{Teacher1 Teacher2}
                BusinessManager-&gt;ITManager
                {rank=same;ITManager Teacher1 Teacher2}  // Put them on the same level
}
```

